          "flow": [{"from": {"array": "Sp", "index": 0}, "to": {"array": "B", "index": 4}, "text": "␣"}]
        },
        {
          "line": 2,
          "caption": "`append` hands back the same builder, so the second `append` carries on in the same object: seven more characters, and still room to spare.",
